                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "Arroz con Pollo"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is built on sofrito, the Latin American base of onion, garlic and peppers cooked down together. The chicken browns first, then everything goes into one pot with rice and stock. The rice absorbs the flavoured cooking liquid and becomes golden and fragrant."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use bone-in chicken thighs for the best flavour. They stay juicier than breast and hold up through the full cooking time."
          }
        ]
      },
